    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehobowami hakuya kuShekemi, muloŋa aIsarela ejima enjili kuShekemi nakumudiisha wanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowami wadiŋi nakushakama muEjipitu, muloŋa henohu wachidiŋi muEjipitu mwatemukililiyi mwanta Solomoni; mwana kaNebati Yerobowami hakuchitiya, hiyakunamutumesha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowami nachipompelucha waIsarela chejima hiyakwinza nakuhosha naRehobowami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Tata yeyi watukalishilili mpanda yetu. Ichi dinu tupepesheli nyidimuyatata yeyi yakala, nimpanda yindi yalema yatutwikiliyi, ninetu twakakukalakelaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila nindi, Yenu mwakajiŋi kasatu, mwakafunti cheŋi kudami. Antu hiyakuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Rehobowami hakukwata mpùŋa nawawakulumpi, emenaŋa kumesu atata yindi Solomoni hadiŋiyi wuchidi mumi, nindi, Nlejenu chachiwahi munukuyakwila antu awa, nukuyila namidi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumwilanawu, Neyi wukwi kala jimba yawantu awa lelu, wuyikalakelaŋa, wuyakulaŋa wuhoshapa nawu mazu amawahi, akekala ambuŋeyi haya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa yena walekeli maana amulejeluwu awakulumpi, hakukwata mpupana wanyikwenzi akulililiyi nawu hamu, emenaŋi kumesu indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyilanindi, Nlejenu chachiwahi namutukuyakwila antu awa anaŋili nawu, Pepeshakumpanda yatutwikili tata yeyi. Tukuyila netwidi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyikwenzikuliliyi nawu hamu hiyakumwila nawu, Tiya chiwakayila antu awa anakwilinawu, Tata yeyi watulemesheleli mpanda yetu, eyi tupepesheliyi. Kayilineyi, Munu wami wakanyansa wunabadiki nkuma yatata kutoha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatayami wayitwikili mpanda yalema, kumpanda yenu ami nakalunjikaku. Tata yami wayetelapa yikotu, ami nakayeta tunjimbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowami nawantu ejima hiyakwinza kudi Rehobowami ifukuda muchisatu mwomwayilejeliyi mwanta, nindi, Mwakenzi cheŋi kudami ifuku damu chisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakutalumokela antu, walekeli maana amulejeluwu awakulumpi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakuyila mwamulejeluwu anyikwenzi, nindi, Tatayami wayilemesheleli mpanda yenu, kumpanda yenu ami nakalunjikaku. Tata yami wayetelapa yikotu, ami nakayeta tunjimbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hayitiyilili antuku, muloŋa chumochu chafumini kudi Yehova, kulonda kukoleshaizu dahosheliyi Yehova kukanwa kaAhiya wakuShilo kudi mwana kaNebati Yerobowami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela ejima chamwenuwu mwanta kuyitiyilila nehi, antu hiyakumwakula mwanta nawu, Etu twadyaŋi naDavidi? Hitwabomba wuswanana mwana kajesuku. Enu aIsarela mwaŋelenu kunyikala yenu, eyi Davidi kaditalili itala deyeyi aweni. AIsarela amwaŋela nikunyikala yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza anyana kaIsarela ashakamini munyikala yamuYuda Rehobowami hakwikala mwanta wawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Rehobowami watemesheluku Adorami, wadiŋi mukulumpi wanyilambu. AIsarela ejima hiyakumwasa malola, afwa nikufwa. Mwanta Rehobowami hakunyakala kukandama mwikalu dindi, hakutemukila kuYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela adikaŋa namutaŋa waDavidi nilelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela ejima chatiyiluwu nawu Yerobowami nafunti dehi, hiyakutemesha antunakumutambika enzi kuchipompelu, hiyakumudiisha wanta wawaIsarela ejima. Kwosi wakumini kumutaŋa waDaviduku chiŋa wowu muchidi waYuda hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehobowami chashikiliyi kuYerusalema, hakupompesha mutaŋa waYuda wejima, nimuchidi waBenjamini, amayala akutonda chakutonda makombakaji nkulakaji namakombakaji makumi atanu nasatu, adiŋi akwakulwa, kulonda akalwi namutaŋa waIsarela, akafuntishi cheŋi wanta kudi mwana kaSolomoni Rehobowami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa izu daNzambi hidikwinza kudi Shemaya muntu waNzambi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hoshaku naRehobowami, mwana kaSolomoni, mwanta wawa-Yuda, namutaŋa waYuda naBenjamini wejima, niantu anashaluku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi, Yehova nahoshi, nindi, Bayi mwakaya kwoku, bayi mwakalwa nawanakwenu anyana kaIsarelaku. Funtenu kumatalenu wejima wenu. Muloŋa chumichi chinafumi kudami. Hiyakutiyilila mwizu daYehova, hiyakufuntamu, hiyakudiyila kwawu, mwomwizu daYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowami watuŋili Shekemi mwituŋa daEfweremi damapidi, hakushakamamu. Hakufuma kwenoku hakutuŋa Penuweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowami hakuhosha mumuchima windi, nindi, Komana wanta hiwukufunta cheŋi kumutaŋa waDavidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa antu neyi akuyaŋa nakulambula nyilambu mwitala daYehova kuYerusalema, nyichima yawantu awa yakenza kabalumukila cheŋi kudi nkaka yawu Rehobowami mwantawa waYuda; akanjahami, hiyakafunta cheŋi kudi Rehobowami mwantawa waYuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakukwata mpùŋa, hakwila anyana kaŋombi awuru ayedi, hakuleja antu nindi, Enu aIsarela, kuya kuYerusalema chinayikalili dehi, talenu akishi enu ayifumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wumuwamushili muBeteli, mukwawu wamushili muDani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chumichi chabalumukili hinshidi, muloŋa antu ayilaŋa nakufukaminahela iwu, hela wakuDani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakutuŋa nawa matala ahayinaŋanaŋa, hakukwata atupristu akufuma mukachi kawantu ejima ákubula kwikalaanyana kaLevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowami hakushamu chawija chamukakweji kamuchitanu nachisatu, chefuku dekumi nakatanu dakakweji, chidi neyi chawija chamuYuda, hakukandama nikukamepa. Dimu mweliliyi muBeteli, owuanyana kaŋombi eliliyi hakuyiketwila yimuna. MuBeteli hakushamu atupristu akuyinaŋanaŋa yeliliyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku dekumi nakatanu mukakwejika muchitanu nachisatu, kokakweji kakudifuukwila mumuchimawindi yomwenindi, hakukandama kukameŋa keliliyi muBeteli. Hakushamu chawija chawanvana kaIsarela, hakukandama nikukameŋa nakwocha insensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
